WEBVTT

00:01.230 --> 00:03.170
An elite boy's school.

00:03.330 --> 00:06.170
I transferred after the semester began.

00:06.340 --> 00:09.170
I had no idea what was waiting for me.

00:09.300 --> 00:12.070
I thought it was just a school full of guys...

00:12.170 --> 00:13.440
...but why do I see a girl?

00:13.580 --> 00:14.670
I'm a guy!

00:14.780 --> 00:15.330
Huh?

00:15.440 --> 00:16.640
But that skirt...

00:16.750 --> 00:18.710
What are you saying?
You're going to wear it too.

00:18.810 --> 00:19.300
What?

00:19.410 --> 00:21.650
The three of us are in this together.

00:21.750 --> 00:23.450
Let's do a great job, okay?

00:23.550 --> 00:25.150
No!

00:25.320 --> 00:29.380
And this is how my life as a princess began...

00:30.360 --> 00:36.990
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

00:37.130 --> 00:43.730
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

00:44.640 --> 00:49.700
<i>I know what I want to</i> <i>say to you every time.</i>

00:49.850 --> 00:56.410
<i>I always have them</i> <i>hidden inside my heart.</i>

00:57.390 --> 01:02.090
<i>I know it's an important feeling...</i>

01:02.320 --> 01:07.760
<i>...and I'm keeping it warm</i> <i>to give it to you someday.</i>

01:10.070 --> 01:15.730
<i>The sound of the bells</i>
<i>I hear from far away...</i>

01:15.840 --> 01:22.640
<i>...makes my heart beat faster and</i> <i>cuts through the sky like the wind.</i>

01:22.780 --> 01:29.450
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

01:29.550 --> 01:35.250
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

01:35.460 --> 01:42.130
<i>And when it's time to tell you</i> <i>the things I've been wanting to say</i>

01:42.260 --> 01:47.930
<i>You're my sunshine, an eternal smile!</i>

01:48.240 --> 01:58.240
<i>Our prologue, to this exciting story...</i>

02:00.550 --> 02:06.010
<i>The School Festival Begins</i>

02:30.650 --> 02:34.480
<i>Seven days until the school</i> <i>festival. Good luck!</i>

02:34.980 --> 02:37.380
<i>Conference room</i>

02:37.650 --> 02:39.880
What? My older brother?

02:40.090 --> 02:40.950
That's right.

02:41.060 --> 02:44.460
He's going to participate in the first day of orientation.

02:44.560 --> 02:46.490
Mr. Sakamoto is very enthusiastic about this.

02:46.630 --> 02:48.360
I'm sure it'll be exciting.

02:49.230 --> 02:51.960
When was this decided...

02:52.230 --> 02:53.700
Hey you know...

02:54.270 --> 02:56.000
I need you to do me a favor.

02:56.140 --> 02:56.970
Favor?

02:57.070 --> 03:01.770
You're not going to say you're backing out at the last minute...

03:01.910 --> 03:03.880
I wouldn't do that!

03:04.610 --> 03:08.380
We have to be dressed up as princesses during the entire festival, right?

03:08.480 --> 03:09.350
So?

03:09.450 --> 03:12.010
You don't like that?

03:10.450 --> 03:12.010
<i>That's not what I mean!</i>

03:12.220 --> 03:13.690
Well...

03:13.790 --> 03:15.660
It's just...

03:15.820 --> 03:20.520
I was wondering if I can take 2 or 3 hours off during break time on the second day...

03:20.860 --> 03:21.960
Ah...

03:22.100 --> 03:24.120
So your girlfriend is coming?

03:24.270 --> 03:25.500
I see.

03:25.670 --> 03:27.730
You don't want her to see you in a princess outfit.

03:27.900 --> 03:29.100
Please!

03:29.200 --> 03:33.160
I'll wear the outfit at all other times and promise to do my job!

03:33.340 --> 03:36.180
Let me take a break for a little bit, I'm begging you!

03:36.650 --> 03:40.910
Well, if the event goes smoothly, then we don't mind.

03:41.050 --> 03:42.310
That's right.

03:42.420 --> 03:46.750
But shouldn't you be asking other people for permission?

03:46.860 --> 03:47.480
Yeah.

03:57.400 --> 03:58.560
I don't mind.

03:59.000 --> 03:59.660
What?

03:59.770 --> 04:00.630
No way!

04:00.740 --> 04:01.930
This is surprising.

04:02.070 --> 04:05.600
Well, President Arisada isn't that strict...

04:05.970 --> 04:11.280
As long as you do your job, I don't care what you do with your free time.

04:11.480 --> 04:12.780
But...

04:12.910 --> 04:15.910
I won't let you back down from any of the events.

04:16.080 --> 04:19.250
Even if you have a fever, you'll have to do it with an intravenous drip attached.

04:19.350 --> 04:20.880
Just keep that in mind.

04:21.620 --> 04:23.350
He's a demon after all.

04:23.490 --> 04:25.090
What about you guys?

04:25.530 --> 04:28.360
Expecting any family members or guests?

04:28.460 --> 04:30.360
No, I'm not expecting anyone...

04:30.970 --> 04:34.930
I never tell my family about what I do in school.

04:40.240 --> 04:43.110
This is a really weird forest...

04:43.210 --> 04:47.740
We have no choice but to ask the witch for her powers...

04:48.550 --> 04:51.110
But what the heck is this script?

04:51.220 --> 04:53.350
Looks like it's one of
President's hobbies...

04:53.460 --> 04:55.790
The story is all over the place.

04:56.220 --> 04:57.850
Are you sure this is okay?

04:57.990 --> 04:59.830
Can you go against that man?

04:59.930 --> 05:01.520
We don't have much time.

05:01.630 --> 05:03.620
Stop complaining and practice.

05:04.600 --> 05:06.970
Hey look! It's a river.

05:07.940 --> 05:09.730
This is part of our job?

05:09.940 --> 05:12.700
If we go along this river, then we'll get to the lake...

05:25.920 --> 05:29.020
<i>School festival</i>

05:29.290 --> 05:32.560
And this wraps up our opening ceremony.

05:32.790 --> 05:35.130
Now this is what you've all been waiting for!

05:35.300 --> 05:36.460
Our special event!

05:36.560 --> 05:38.830
<i>We'll begin the orientation hosted by...</i>

05:37.200 --> 05:40.340
You think Mr. Sakamoto is here now?

05:38.900 --> 05:41.530
<i>...the wonderful student organization.</i>

05:40.440 --> 05:41.530
Probably.

05:41.640 --> 05:42.730
I didn't see him though.

05:42.840 --> 05:46.400
Hey, what's the previous
Mr. Sakamoto like?

05:46.710 --> 05:48.470
You guys met him, right?

05:48.580 --> 05:50.340
What's he like?

05:53.450 --> 05:57.390
Why didn't you tell me about this important dinner, Akira?

05:57.490 --> 06:00.790
I tried sending an email to your cell phone but...

06:01.020 --> 06:02.290
Oh, I see...

06:03.230 --> 06:04.890
He's not really all that.

06:05.060 --> 06:06.760
I mean he is beautiful.

06:06.860 --> 06:09.660
It's all just a rumor.

06:09.760 --> 06:12.890
If you see him in person, you'll be disappointed.

06:13.000 --> 06:13.900
Really?

06:14.340 --> 06:18.640
Before I explain the rules, I would like to welcome a special guest.

06:19.140 --> 06:20.570
Who could it be?

06:20.680 --> 06:21.970
A special guest?

06:22.080 --> 06:23.570
Is he that great?

06:24.850 --> 06:27.510
Legendary alumnus of Fujimori Academy!

06:30.720 --> 06:32.450
Mr. Sakamoto!

06:37.030 --> 06:38.320
It's Mr. Sakamoto!

06:38.460 --> 06:40.520
Is that him? Is that Mr. Sakamoto?

06:40.630 --> 06:42.120
I can't believe it!

06:43.060 --> 06:45.090
What do you mean disappointing?

06:45.200 --> 06:47.930
It can't be...

06:46.100 --> 06:47.930
<i>This is strange...</i>

06:48.140 --> 06:50.000
Please be quiet everyone!

06:50.340 --> 06:51.240
Quiet!

06:51.910 --> 06:53.880
Please be quiet!

06:54.610 --> 06:57.600
Now the president is going to explain the rules.

06:58.450 --> 07:01.810
To explain it in simple terms, it's like a stamp rally.

07:02.250 --> 07:04.810
Whoever can get the correct stamps on this card...

07:04.920 --> 07:06.950
...in the fastest time will be declared the winner.

07:07.790 --> 07:09.550
Three student organization members.

07:10.230 --> 07:12.160
Three princesses.

07:12.630 --> 07:17.120
And we also have the previous Mr. Sakamoto as well.

07:17.400 --> 07:20.560
That's a total of 7 stamps you need to collect.

07:20.700 --> 07:24.540
Now the stamps are named for each individual...

07:24.870 --> 07:27.710
...but the stamps for the princess will be a kissmark instead.

07:30.650 --> 07:32.640
That's what I don't like.

07:32.780 --> 07:34.550
We just have to kiss the card, right?

07:34.650 --> 07:36.450
It's part of the job, J-O-B.

07:37.020 --> 07:39.720
But it won't be that easy.

07:39.850 --> 07:41.150
In order to get the stamps...

07:41.260 --> 07:44.990
you need to beat each of the student organization members.

07:45.160 --> 07:48.760
Plus the princesses can move freely and counterattack if necessary.

07:49.000 --> 07:53.160
Mr. Sakamoto is a tough opponent as well.

07:54.740 --> 07:56.430
The prize will be 100,000 yen.

07:56.640 --> 08:00.700
We will start in 10 minutes with the sound of the whistle.

08:06.510 --> 08:08.350
Should we go somewhere for a break?

08:08.480 --> 08:09.110
Yeah.

08:09.250 --> 08:12.780
Don't even think about running away, Mikoto.

08:12.950 --> 08:14.980
I-I know!

08:15.120 --> 08:16.090
Okay, let's go.

08:16.190 --> 08:19.530
Is that you, Yu-chan?

08:21.260 --> 08:22.660
Yu?

08:26.870 --> 08:28.100
Yujirou?

08:28.400 --> 08:29.740
Mother...

08:29.940 --> 08:31.800
What? Shihoudani's parents?

08:32.110 --> 08:33.840
I was surprised.

08:33.940 --> 08:37.380
I couldn't tell if it was you because of those clothes.

08:37.480 --> 08:40.540
Yu, why are you dressed like that?

08:41.020 --> 08:43.320
You really surprised me.

08:43.490 --> 08:46.980
I'll introduce them to you guys, my parents and my little brother, Shinnosuke.

08:47.520 --> 08:48.820
Hello.

08:48.920 --> 08:51.190
Thank you for looking after him.

08:51.360 --> 08:53.450
Hey Shin-chan, you should say hello.

08:56.360 --> 08:58.360
Hey Shin-chan.

08:58.470 --> 08:59.930
What's wrong?

09:00.840 --> 09:06.140
He hasn't seen his brother in a while, so maybe he forgot about you.

09:06.240 --> 09:09.140
Shinnosuke is shy in front of strangers.

09:09.980 --> 09:11.950
And this is my friend...

09:12.050 --> 09:13.240
I'm Kouno.

09:13.350 --> 09:15.180
Ah, I'm Yutaka.

09:15.280 --> 09:17.380
Well, you see this outfit is...

09:17.690 --> 09:19.650
For the school festival, isn't it?

09:19.750 --> 09:21.450
It's part of some program, right?

09:21.560 --> 09:22.920
We're in the middle of a game.

09:23.020 --> 09:25.320
Yes, that's correct, we're in the middle of a game.

09:25.430 --> 09:27.330
We don't dress like this all the time.

09:27.430 --> 09:28.490
Mikoto!

09:28.600 --> 09:31.400
Game, eh? I see.

09:31.770 --> 09:32.930
But...

09:34.270 --> 09:36.930
It looks good on you, Yu-chan.

09:38.440 --> 09:39.640
Thanks.

09:39.740 --> 09:41.800
But why did you come all of a sudden?

09:41.910 --> 09:45.640
Well, you never came home for the summer.

09:46.110 --> 09:48.480
We heard about the school festival today...

09:48.620 --> 09:50.880
...so we decided to come and see you.

09:50.990 --> 09:53.110
Actual events for non-students are for tomorrow.

09:53.220 --> 09:56.320
Events for today are for students only...

09:56.420 --> 09:57.150
What?

09:57.230 --> 09:58.820
Really? What should we do?

09:59.760 --> 10:02.030
Well, you did come all the way out here.

10:02.160 --> 10:06.690
I have to work, so I can't show you guys around, but take a look around if you like.

10:06.800 --> 10:08.900
You can't just take time off of work?

10:09.070 --> 10:09.830
I can't...

10:10.210 --> 10:12.330
I'll be finished late in the afternoon though...

10:12.440 --> 10:15.770
We came here to see you, but that's too bad...

10:16.580 --> 10:19.100
Mother, you could've told me in advance.

10:19.210 --> 10:19.870
But...

10:20.010 --> 10:25.210
It looks like they're getting along just fine, but...

10:25.990 --> 10:29.320
It's not that I don't want to go home.

10:29.490 --> 10:33.120
I look at my family and I feel like I don't belong there.

10:33.230 --> 10:35.390
That's what I can't stand.

10:38.430 --> 10:41.400
I saw my mother, father, and brother...

10:41.540 --> 10:45.270
Then I thought, "What a perfect family"

10:45.410 --> 10:48.810
But if I add myself to the mix, then their perfect balance will be ruined.

10:48.980 --> 10:51.380
I feel alienated.

10:52.850 --> 10:57.080
Tohru, Yujirou, Yutaka, we'll be starting soon so get ready!

10:57.250 --> 10:58.950
Ah, I forgot about that.

10:59.120 --> 11:00.590
Let's go Yujirou.

11:00.690 --> 11:01.450
Yeah...

11:01.560 --> 11:03.820
I'll see you later, mother.

11:03.990 --> 11:05.360
Come on, Shin-chan.

11:06.630 --> 11:08.190
It's okay, mother.

11:08.300 --> 11:09.590
I'll see you later too teacher.

11:12.730 --> 11:15.140
It started! Let's go.

11:15.270 --> 11:17.070
Well, enjoy yourselves.

11:17.270 --> 11:17.830
Yeah.

11:17.940 --> 11:18.960
Good luck.

11:21.040 --> 11:22.370
Yujirou...

11:49.140 --> 11:50.440
Ready...

11:50.540 --> 11:51.530
Go!

11:59.680 --> 12:02.620
If you make a donation, then you can get a stamp without challenging me.

12:02.720 --> 12:04.020
Donation will be 100 yen.

12:04.220 --> 12:05.920
Donate over here.

12:10.190 --> 12:13.130
Now, can you guess where the coin is?

12:14.800 --> 12:16.060
This one. This has to be it!

12:18.130 --> 12:19.530
Sorry.

12:21.240 --> 12:23.300
You can donate over there.

12:24.170 --> 12:26.900
...6 + 38 + 49 + 59?

12:27.280 --> 12:28.830
20957.

12:29.380 --> 12:30.780
What?

12:31.810 --> 12:33.210
Donate over there.

12:36.680 --> 12:37.810
I know.

12:37.920 --> 12:41.080
I shouldn't run away,
I know that real well.

12:41.360 --> 12:42.190
But...

12:42.320 --> 12:43.220
Princess!

12:43.320 --> 12:44.590
I need your stamp!

12:44.990 --> 12:47.220
Princess! Please give me your stamp!

12:47.700 --> 12:50.530
But, but, but...

12:50.970 --> 12:55.200
When they chase me around, it's in my nature to run away!

13:09.850 --> 13:10.980
Here you go.

13:11.090 --> 13:13.380
Thank you so much, princess!

13:19.960 --> 13:21.790
No, this is too much!

13:22.060 --> 13:23.790
Then I'll go!

13:26.800 --> 13:29.860
Mr. Sakamoto! I...

13:32.410 --> 13:33.810
You want my stamp?

13:33.940 --> 13:35.030
Sure.

13:37.710 --> 13:38.740
No way!

13:38.850 --> 13:40.870
I'm too scared to get near him!

13:40.980 --> 13:42.180
You can't do it, either?

13:42.950 --> 13:44.440
He's really amazing.

13:44.650 --> 13:48.110
But he wasn't like that when we last saw him.

13:48.420 --> 13:49.820
Brother Haru.

13:50.020 --> 13:51.150
How is everything?

13:51.260 --> 13:53.390
Sorry, but I've been busy.

13:57.630 --> 13:59.160
Akira!

13:59.330 --> 14:01.430
You're so mean!

14:01.770 --> 14:05.830
I thought that if I came to the festival, I could be with you more!

14:05.970 --> 14:08.440
Brother Haru, calm down...

14:10.310 --> 14:12.440
So that's how it is...

14:20.150 --> 14:21.620
Yujirou...

14:22.760 --> 14:24.660
<i>Art room</i>

14:25.590 --> 14:29.330
I'm glad Yuchan looks well..

14:39.110 --> 14:40.670
I'm so busy!

14:40.780 --> 14:43.750
The actual performance is tomorrow, but they're not here to try on the wardrobes...

14:43.850 --> 14:45.140
Unbelievable!

14:50.420 --> 14:52.410
Did you see Princess Tohru or Yujirou?

14:52.790 --> 14:54.280
No, they're nowhere to be found.

14:54.390 --> 14:57.020
They're not here either, let's go somewhere else.

14:57.330 --> 15:00.450
In 10 minutes, the orientation will be over.

15:00.630 --> 15:04.590
I'm glad you participated in this event.

15:04.700 --> 15:05.220
What?

15:05.330 --> 15:07.700
None of the students succeeded.

15:07.840 --> 15:11.070
The prize money and the donations all belong to the student organization now.

15:12.070 --> 15:14.670
There's nothing more to worry about.

15:14.840 --> 15:18.400
I get it now...

15:20.420 --> 15:23.280
You want to talk now?
We're still working.

15:23.850 --> 15:26.950
You called your father "teacher" right?

15:28.060 --> 15:32.430
You haven't talked to them ever since that time?

15:34.800 --> 15:37.790
You said you felt alienated from your family...

15:38.400 --> 15:41.730
...but that was all your fault.

15:42.800 --> 15:45.330
So you were going to talk to them about it.

15:45.870 --> 15:48.140
You were going to fix those misplaced buttons.

15:48.240 --> 15:49.940
Isn't that what you said?

15:50.140 --> 15:52.210
I was ignored...

15:51.410 --> 15:52.210
<i>What?</i>

15:52.310 --> 15:53.610
Shinnosuke...

15:54.020 --> 15:55.510
He was ignoring me...

15:59.650 --> 16:00.820
That's not true!

16:01.060 --> 16:04.990
Remember what your father said?
He's shy in front of strangers.

16:05.190 --> 16:07.960
Maybe he was just surprised to see you in a princess wardrobe.

16:08.100 --> 16:09.560
It's no use.

16:09.700 --> 16:10.860
Are we done?

16:10.970 --> 16:13.800
We better get back to work, or
President Arisada might get upset.

16:14.000 --> 16:15.260
Don't jump to conclusions!

16:16.470 --> 16:17.870
You should just talk to them.

16:18.170 --> 16:20.070
Do you hate your brother?

16:20.170 --> 16:20.900
Of course not!

16:21.010 --> 16:22.240
Then talk to him!

16:22.380 --> 16:24.400
Tell him how you truly feel!

16:26.910 --> 16:28.340
Yu-chan!

16:27.680 --> 16:28.340
<i>Yu!</i>

16:28.950 --> 16:30.150
Mother, what's wrong?

16:30.250 --> 16:32.190
Shinchan... He's missing!

16:32.920 --> 16:34.790
We just took our eyes off of him for a second and...

16:34.890 --> 16:37.590
We looked for him, but he's nowhere to be found...

16:37.930 --> 16:39.720
You guys!

16:40.360 --> 16:42.300
Why aren't you working?

16:46.030 --> 16:46.800
Go!

16:46.900 --> 16:47.630
What?

16:47.740 --> 16:50.900
Leave this to us, you go and find Shinnosuke.

16:51.010 --> 16:51.530
But...

16:51.640 --> 16:52.660
Didn't I tell you before?

16:52.770 --> 16:55.400
I'll stay by your side even when you're hurting.

16:58.250 --> 17:00.770
Tell him how you feel.

17:05.920 --> 17:07.650
Yu-chan!

17:06.890 --> 17:07.650
<i>Yu!</i>

17:07.820 --> 17:09.310
Shihoudani!

17:10.260 --> 17:11.520
Everyone!

17:12.290 --> 17:14.760
Here's a special rule!

17:16.500 --> 17:20.300
Princess Mikoto and I are going to kiss for Princess Yujiro's as well!

17:20.400 --> 17:21.230
What?

17:21.370 --> 17:25.430
Now please get in line to receive our kisses!

17:25.640 --> 17:26.610
Smooch!

17:29.280 --> 17:31.800
Now we'll give our kisses in order.

17:32.150 --> 17:33.640
Hey, get in line you guys!

17:33.780 --> 17:35.940
Where do you think you're touching?

17:38.490 --> 17:41.390
<i>Science lab</i>

17:40.050 --> 17:41.390
Shinnosuke!

17:42.560 --> 17:43.960
Shinnosuke!

17:45.430 --> 17:47.260
Shinnosuke!

17:49.660 --> 17:51.190
Shinnosuke...

18:18.830 --> 18:21.060
There, there...
What's the matter?

18:21.930 --> 18:24.590
You're a good boy, so don't cry.

18:24.730 --> 18:26.170
There now...

18:27.940 --> 18:29.300
Shinnosuke...

18:30.610 --> 18:32.230
Well, I'm going now...

18:32.570 --> 18:34.370
Take care.

18:34.510 --> 18:36.500
Come home once in a while ok?

18:42.820 --> 18:46.220
Shinnosuke!

19:13.050 --> 19:14.710
Shinnosuke...

19:22.190 --> 19:23.560
Shinnosuke!

19:25.030 --> 19:27.960
Don't worry! You're okay now.

19:29.100 --> 19:31.730
Your brother's here.

19:38.310 --> 19:39.640
Shinnosuke?

19:41.210 --> 19:42.370
Shinnosuke!

19:43.410 --> 19:44.570
Shinnosuke!

19:45.150 --> 19:46.310
Shinnosuke!

19:48.880 --> 19:52.320
Up you go!

19:52.920 --> 19:54.620
Once more!

19:58.660 --> 20:01.820
Sorry for troubling you today...

20:02.200 --> 20:04.930
Well, take care...

20:05.470 --> 20:06.530
Okay...

20:06.670 --> 20:07.830
Yujirou.

20:08.200 --> 20:08.830
Yeah.

20:08.970 --> 20:10.030
Come on!

20:13.410 --> 20:14.640
You know...

20:16.840 --> 20:19.310
I'll be coming home for my next break.

20:20.280 --> 20:21.040
Father...

20:22.380 --> 20:23.720
Yu!

20:24.050 --> 20:26.280
Why are you crying?

20:26.390 --> 20:28.080
Because Yu...

20:28.190 --> 20:30.560
Yu called me father!

20:32.130 --> 20:34.620
Thank you, Yu-chan.

20:36.130 --> 20:39.290
No! I don't want to go home!

20:39.370 --> 20:43.560
Oh my, you really like Yu-chan now, huh?

20:39.600 --> 20:43.560
<i>I want to play with my brother!</i>

20:44.070 --> 20:46.700
Don't worry, we'll see each other again soon.

20:46.910 --> 20:50.000
Really? I'll see you soon?

20:50.210 --> 20:52.180
Yeah, I'm sure.

20:52.280 --> 20:53.840
Really? Really?

20:53.980 --> 20:54.910
Yeah.

20:55.520 --> 20:59.610
You know what? I always want to be with you.

20:59.790 --> 21:01.760
So...

21:02.460 --> 21:05.020
I'm going to marry you!

21:19.140 --> 21:21.510
Marriage?

21:21.940 --> 21:25.240
He was able to get his family back together...

21:25.510 --> 21:28.610
...but it looks like we have a new problem...

21:41.900 --> 21:49.460
<i>If you're sad and feeling</i> <i>down, then call out to me.</i>

21:49.570 --> 21:57.640
<i>I'll be in the area, so let</i> <i>me know what's bothering you.</i>

21:58.150 --> 22:05.480
<i>If you're all by yourself,</i> <i>then you'll forget how to smile.</i>

22:05.590 --> 22:13.320
<i>A smile is something you</i> <i>share with another person.</i>

22:13.460 --> 22:23.460
<i>Hey, the future you can see</i> <i>from the classroom window...</i>

22:23.700 --> 22:30.300
<i>...is getting larger after</i> <i>taking in the sunlight.</i>

22:30.640 --> 22:32.140
<i>Smile at me!</i>

22:32.280 --> 22:40.020
<i>Smile is what makes you feel energetic!</i>

22:40.120 --> 22:46.120
<i>I want to give some smiles to you...</i>

22:46.260 --> 22:48.290
<i>...right away.</i>

22:48.560 --> 22:58.560
<i>In order for you to lift</i> <i>your head up and start walking.</i>

23:05.110 --> 23:10.070
Next Episode, Time for Lovers
